<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_align_left ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;">Topic Coverage-based Demonstration Retrieval for In-Context Learning</span></h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
